rior elections in Rizia were symbolic at best, these ones matter. Please inform yourselves before heading to the ballot box.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [8], "isPlayer": true, "isRoot": 0}, {"id": 15, "actorId": 95, "speaker": "Player_Romus", "title": "Player_Romus: \"\"I began these reforms with the hel...\"", "dialogueText": "\"I began these reforms with the help of the Rizian People's Party. I urge you to vote for them, so that we may complete the trajectory that we started together.\"", "menuText": "", "conditions": "", "userScript": "", "outgoing": [8], "isPlayer": true, "isRoot": 0}]}